{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116376","id":3291608210,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7EMfSS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116376","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116376.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116376.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116376","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116376/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116376/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116376/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/870631211f507b302b3fbc289a62891115ad7a29","number":116376,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Wayland: Skip resize request when the size is the same","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #116304.\r\nFollow up to #114082.\r\n\r\n`DisplayServer::window_set_size` is called lots of times in the code, with the assumption (I suppose) that it's going to be idempotent.\r\n\r\nWe had checks in `_update_window_rect` but we still called `WaylandThread::window_set_size`, which did a lot of stuff. In particular, this caused issues with HiDPI as it \"overrode\" the window size before it had a time to figure out its scale.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTested on:\r\n - Fedora 43 VM with COSMIC 1.0.1, GNOME 49.2, KDE 6.5.4\r\n - KISS Linux with labwc 0.9.3-49-g654da8c8 (built from git), sway 1.11.\r\n\r\nBoth with and without #116308.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4"